# ==============================================================================
# NAME: United States Internet Services Complete Rule-Set (USA_SERVICE.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Exhaustive coverage of US-based internet ecosystems (Media,
#              Streaming, Social, Cloud/SaaS, DevOps, Package Registries,
#              Design, Productivity & Fintech) not in dedicated brand rule-sets.
#              Each company includes main domains, shorteners, CDNs, APIs & auth.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/USA_SERVICE.list,"🇺🇸 USA Service",extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

